OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 18, charged after ship crew
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third person has been charged after
OL,7,Fthree ship workers were attacked.
OL,9,FPreston Stabb, from Shirehampton in
OL,10,FBristol, was re-arrested on Wednesday
OL,11,Fand charged with causing grievous
OL,12,Fbodily harm with intent and common
OL,13,Fassault.
OL,15,FThe 18-year-old is expected to appear
OL,16,Fat Bristol Magistrates' Court later.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
