OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 18, charged after ship crew
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ship workers, who are from the
OL,7,FPhilippines, sustained serious injuries
OL,8,Fin an incident on Richmond Terrace,
OL,9,Fnear Avonmouth Docks on 31 July, with
OL,10,Fone remaining in a critical condition
OL,11,Fin hospital. Another man will appear at
OL,12,FBristol Crown Court on Friday.
